                          <Style><BackgroundColor>#1e293b</BackgroundColor><PaddingLeft>4pt</PaddingLeft><PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight><PaddingTop>4pt</PaddingTop><PaddingBottom>4pt</PaddingBottom><Border><Color>#cbd5e1</Color><Style>Solid</Style></Border></Style>
                        </Textbox>
                      </CellContents>
                    </TablixCell>
                    <!-- 3. Designation -->
